  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Market Oriented Investments and Innovations for Sustainable Agrifood System Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the development cooperation among the parties is:

Innovative and climate-smart agribusiness sustainably contributes to inclusive economic growth and the welfare of the Palestinian people
The development cooperation among the parties will contribute to Strategic Objective 2 of the Strategic Framework for Denmark&#x2019;s engagement in 2021 to 2025 , which is &#x201c;Creation of Green, Sustainable Inclusive Economic Growth and Decent Jobs with a particular focus on Women and Youth&#x201d;. The project&#x2019;s objective contributes to a substantial part of the strategic objective as the largest project under this component.</narrative>
  </description>
